      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll check what's in the working directory.Now I'll write the improved test file with clearer variable names and explanatory comments.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test uses descriptive variable names (`injectionId`, `trueValue`, `originalValue`, `valueWithNullOptional`) and adds inline comments explaining the setup, the action under test, and each assertion's intent."
